Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 02:04:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Snapshot: gmod-1.6.1 working tree during the remix-1.6.1
 merge

The working tree of the main checkout as of 2026-10-29, mid-merge of tag
remix-1.6.1 (submodules/rtxdi unresolved, so submodules are not part of this
commit). It is the source of the shipped d3d9.dll (SHA-256 A8E39D93...,
built 2026-10-27 11:32; no source file is newer). Not a real merge: it only
gives the i18n work a base that matches the runtime in the RTX package.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
