 harmless unknown-option warning.
 
 ---
+
+## RTX Remix 1.6.1 merge
+
+Branch `gmod-1.6.1` merges NVIDIA `remix-1.6.1` (`0a6cd5b1`) into `gmod-numos3` (`c6b48ed1`). These
+are the places where the merge did more than pick a side, so the next upstream merge knows what to
+re-check.
+
+### API
+
+- **`public/include/remix/remix_c.h`** - inline tweak.
+  *`REMIXAPI_VERSION` is `0.1000.1`. Upstream's 0.6.5 additions (the four DLSS control mask fields on
+  `remixapi_MaterialInfoOpaqueEXT`) are appended as on upstream.*
+- **`src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_remix_api.cpp`** - inline tweak.
+  *The DLSS control mask fields are read only from clients at `0.1000.1` or newer, because upstream's
+  `0.6.5` gate would also pass `0.1000.0` clients, whose structs end before those fields.
+  `allocateSurfaceGeometry` keeps the fork's per-vertex skinning strides (`bonesPerVertex` weights).
+  `InstanceCategories::Count` is 26: upstream dropped `IgnoreTransparencyLayer`, and the fork adds
+  `LegacyEmissive`.*
+
+### Materials
+
+- **`src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/concept/surface_material/surface_material.h`**,
+  **`src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_materials.h`** - inline tweak.
+  *`OpaqueSurfaceMaterial` now packs `emissiveColorTint` (slots 24-26), `samplerFeedbackStamp` (27),
+  `subsurfaceMaterialIndex` (28-29) and upstream's `dlssControlMask` (30-31). Together they fill the
+  whole 64-byte `MemoryPolymorphicSurfaceMaterial`, so the padding array is gone. The CPU writer
+  follows the same order. `RtOpaqueSurfaceMaterial` is 168 bytes, and its `hashStructByMemory` list
+  names the fork's members as well.*
+
+### Bindings
+
+- **`src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/common_binding_indices.h`** - inline tweak.
+  *Upstream's `BINDING_LIGHT_IDENTITY_BUFFER` (20) is the new `COMMON_MAX_BINDING`. The fork's
+  atmosphere bindings stay at 200-215.*
+- **`src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/sparse_rendering/active_pixel_mask_binding_indices.h`** - inline tweak.
+  *Upstream's 200-211 slots collide with the atmosphere bindings, so they sit at 240-251.
+  `compact_active_pixels_binding_indices.h` keeps upstream's 150-165, which already clear them.*
+- **`src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/composite/composite_binding_indices.h`** - inline tweak.
+  *The aerial perspective inputs stay at 60/61, above upstream's new composite slots.*
+
+### Shaders and tonemapping
+
+- **`src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/tonemap/tonemapping.slangh`** - inline tweak.
+  *Upstream's DLSS-NR fast and inverse tonemap passes call `ACESFilmApproximation`, which the fork's
+  tonemapper no longer has. It is now an alias of `acesNarkowicz`.*
+- **`src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.cpp`** - inline tweak.
+  *The NR passes use `exposureBias()` alone, like the fork's apply pass, since the fork removed the
+  user brightness options. `prewarmShaders` also prewarms the NR passes.*
+- **`src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/algorithm/geometry_resolver.slangh`** - inline tweak.
+  *The PSR miss path no longer shadows `skyRadiance`, so SHaRC sees the volumetric-attenuated sky.*
+- **`src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/composite/composite.comp.slang`** - inline tweak.
+  *The fork still accumulates non-dome sky in the resolver, so upstream's `skyUseProbeForPrimaryRays`
+  branch is unused. With `distanceMode` set to coherent-noise fading, distant surfaces fade toward
+  volumetric radiance only.*
+
+### Assets, mods and lights
+
+- **`src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_mod_usd.cpp`** - inline tweak.
+  *The fork's async reload thread is replaced by upstream's rebuild worker. `UsdMod` keeps the fork's
+  layer and tracked-file API for the mod UI, and `areAsyncOperationsComplete` reports whether a
+  rebuild is in flight. The category schema writer falls back to a generic doc for categories with
+  no documenting option.*
+- **`src/lssusd/remix_category_names.h`**,
+  **`src/usd-plugins/RemixCategories/resources/generatedSchema.usda`** - inline tweak.
+  *Adds `remix_category:legacy_emissive`. `ignore_baked_lighting` has no option, because the fork
+  replaced `rtx.ignoreBakedLightingTextures` with the `rtx.allowBakedLightingTextures` allow-list.*
+- **`src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_asset_replacer.cpp`/`.h`**, **`rtx_scene_manager.cpp`**,
+  **`rtx_fork_submit.cpp`**, **`rtx_fork_hooks.h`** - inline tweak.
+  *The fork's geometry-hash and alias lookups return upstream's shared `ReplacementBucket`. The
+  geometry-hash cache is also cleared when a hot reload is applied. `areAllReplacementsLoaded` and
+  `Mod::path` are restored for the fork's callers.*
+- **`src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_asset_data_manager.cpp`** - inline tweak.
+  *`findAsset` keeps the fork's strict prefix match against search paths on top of upstream's
+  `setSearchPaths`.*
+- **`src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_instance_manager.cpp`** - inline tweak.
+  *GMod's tagged Source eye layout is handled inside upstream's per-draw eye block, ahead of
+  upstream's plane-constant derivation.*
+- **`src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_fork_light.cpp`** - fork-owned change.
+  *`updateLightStaticSleep` preserves upstream's light stable identity, as upstream's own update
+  paths do.*
+- **`src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_fork_rcas.cpp`** - fork-owned change.
+  *The post-FX intermediate texture is an `AliasedResource` on 1.6.1.*
+
+### Build
+
+- **`meson.build`**, **`src/d3d9/meson.build`**, **`src/dxvk/meson.build`** - inline tweak.
+  *`dlss_override/` now replaces `dlss_bin_path`/`dlfg_bin_path`. `REMIX_LIBRARY_EXPORTS` moved to
+  per-target arguments as upstream did. The MSVC link ignores LNK4099 for the PDB-less `sentry.lib`.*
+- **`src/usd-plugins/meson.build`** - inline tweak.
+  *Upstream's codeless plugin build, plus the fork's non-Windows packman selection.*
+- **`.github/workflows/build.yml`** - inline tweak.
+  *No longer runs `scripts/update-dlss-dlls.ps1`: its 310.6.0 bundle is older than the DLSS SDK
+  submodule's 310.9.1.*
+- **`RtxOptions.md`**, **`docs/components/`**, **`src/ogn/lightspeed.trex.logic/`** - regenerated from the
+  merged build, as `test_documentation` and `test_graph_documentation` require.
+- **`submodules/rtxdi`** - merge of the RemixProjGroup volumetrics changes (`3b39a7c7`) and NVIDIA's
+  light identity resolve (`83616205`). The two touch disjoint files.
